flowchart LR
  accTitle: Profile-driven HL7v2 parsing
  accDescr: A Source Profile controls byte normalization, syntactic parsing, and semantic extraction. The result includes canonical events and recoverable warnings.
  RAW["Raw bytes"] --> B["1 · Byte normalization<br/>encoding + framing"]
  B --> S["2 · Syntactic parse<br/>segments + fields + repetitions"]
  S --> E["3 · Semantic extraction<br/>identifiers + event classification"]
  E --> EV["Canonical events<br/>+ parse warnings"]
  PROFILE["Source Profile<br/>tolerance · validation · mapping"]
  PROFILE -.-> B
  PROFILE -.-> S
  PROFILE -.-> E
